  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitating Sustainable Reintegration of Voluntary Returnees through Business Support in Nigeria (Phase 5)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2017, the project aims at contributing to the sustainability of reintegration of voluntary returnees by improving their performance as professional entrepreneurs and thus the durability of individual business projects and reintegration into local structures. It comprises two main components: 1) Entrepreneurship training for voluntary returnees (business training and on-the-job training) and 2) access to micro credits through a SEM-financed revolving fund.</narrative>
  </description>
